Agent `coverage38`, 2026-10-18. Code: `src/coverage38/{theory,lehman,oracle,experiments}.py`
(frozen at the commit that adds this file). Raw output: `experiments/raw/coverage38_{e2,e2s,e3}.jsonl`.
